&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;A Note on Your Privacy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At 8th Light, one of our core values is&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Honesty that builds trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; — and that shapes how we approach hiring. We want you to have a clear picture of &lt;em&gt;who we are&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;how we handle your information&lt;/em&gt; throughout the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Before submitting your application, please take a moment to review our &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://8thlight.com/global-8th-light-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. By applying, you acknowledge that you&#39;ve read it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE POSITION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our roster has an opening with your name on it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineering Director for our Sportsbook Core Apps Enablement group, you&#39;ll be at the forefront of empowering our delivery teams to provide exceptional customer experiences at speed. You&#39;ll manage and mentor multiple engineering teams responsible for building the foundational capabilities, tools, and services that enable our mobile and front-end applications to thrive. Your mission is to ensure our application platforms and backend-for-frontend (BFF) services have the right capabilities, infrastructure, and developer experience to support rapid, high-quality feature delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with engineers on a day-to-day basis, supporting them as they solve complex technical challenges around platform capabilities, developer tooling, and enabling services. You&#39;ll help find opportunities focused on providing the best employee experience while balancing delivery of capabilities that work at scale. You&#39;ll own your software, helping define solutions to problems while mitigating long-term risks. You&#39;ll raise and help mitigate blockers while providing status updates to leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple software development teams with focus on Product Engineering teams as your customers to ensure they have the tools, services, and capabilities to move fast without friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;focused on enablement capabilities where you&#39;ll shape the strategic direction for developer tooling, and foundational capabilities that accelerate product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce and deliver a strategic, technical vision for Core Apps Enablement, identifying gaps in existing capabilities and negotiating ownership across mobile, BFF, and enabling service domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with technical experts across mobile (iOS, Android, Web), BFF services, and with our platform engineering teams to identify opportunities for reusable technology that secure our competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the enablement roadmap for foundational services that successful engineering delivery is built upon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify technology gaps and opportunities in the enablement space, mitigate risks created through technical complexity, and ensure BFF services are designed for scale, reliability, and developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the right people are in the right job through creating leadership opportunities, hiring, performance management, and leading with empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Engineering leadership, platform teams, and product stakeholders to understand their needs and build balanced backlogs and roadmaps that prioritize high-impact enablement capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate, own and drive predictability through Operational Excellence and transparency through data and KPIs - measuring both platform reliability and developer productivity metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure effective operational support for all enablement services in conjunction with IT Operations support organization, treating platform downtime with the same urgency as customer-facing issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with partners and regulatory bodies to establish and follow an effective release process, particularly for mobile app releases and backend service deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver architecturally sound solutions for complex enablement challenges, balancing build vs. buy decisions and ensuring platform services are designed for multi-year horizons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate and drive strategic initiatives (3–5-year horizons) around mobile platform evolution, BFF architecture patterns, and enabling service capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit best behaviour and exemplify our company principles, fostering a culture of enablement, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for expenditure and ensure you spend money effectively, recognizing areas of savings or waste in tooling, infrastructure, and vendor services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE STATS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we&#39;re looking for in our next teammate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ Years in a software role with 5+ years managing SE team(s). Ideally some experience managing managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with mobile application platforms (iOS, Android, Web) and backend-for-frontend (BFF) architectures, with a deep understanding of mobile development challenges and what Engineering teams need to be successful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building strategic capabilities, developer tools, or enablement services that accelerate engineering productivity and reduce friction in the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering technology solutions for consumer facing products in a high energy, ambiguous and scrutinized environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous hands-on experience developing highly available, fault tolerant, resilient applications and transactional platforms from requirements gathering to delivery and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and implementing software delivery best practices, agile delivery methodologies and proven track-record of continuously improving delivery pace while maintaining quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting software systems in production including on-call support with a relentless focus on improving the stability, availability and performance of those systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery of technology solutions working with partner development teams via near-shoring/off-shoring or 3rd party development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and executing a strategic vision for enablement capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of delivering distributed highly scalable and available backend systems &amp;amp; APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Can Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesting work&lt;/strong&gt; - working in a fast-paced and ever-changing industry, new problems and exciting solutions are never too far away. There are always opportunities to learn new skills and broaden your horizons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A sense of achievement&lt;/strong&gt; - Our teams own their own software and when that awesome new feature ships to users and the positive feedback starts rolling in, you can feel really proud of what you and your team created&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal development&lt;/strong&gt; - clear and defined career pathways for every role at every level, a supportive manager, loads of learning opportunities and even 10% of your time to dedicate to your learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging&lt;/strong&gt; - everyone at FanDuel works for each other, we win together, make mistakes together and have lots of fun doing it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust - &lt;/strong&gt;A trusting work environment where productivity is valued above all else, giving you autonomy and ownership of your time and work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great financial package &lt;/strong&gt;- Including salary, bonus, pension, private healthcare, share save scheme, flexible working &amp;amp; holiday policy along with a number of other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FANDUEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is the premier mobile gaming company in the United States and Canada. FanDuel Group consists of a portfolio of leading brands across mobile wagering including: America’s #1 Sportsbook, FanDuel Sportsbook; its leading iGaming platform, FanDuel Casino; the industry’s unquestioned leader in horse racing and advance-deposit wagering, FanDuel Racing; and its daily fantasy sports product. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, FanDuel Group operates FanDuel TV, its broadly distributed linear cable television network and FanDuel TV+, its leading direct-to-consumer OTT platform. FanDuel Group has a presence across all 50 states, Canada, and Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company is based in New York with US offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta, and Jersey City, as well as global offices in Canada and Scotland. The company’s affiliates have offices worldwide, including in Ireland, Portugal, Romania, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is a subsidiary of Flutter Entertainment, the world&#39;s largest sports betting and gaming operator with a portfolio of globally recognized brands and traded on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: FLUT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;FanDuel is an equal opportunities employer. Diversity and inclusion in FanDuel means that we respect and value everyone as individuals. We don&#39;t tolerate bias, judgement or harassment. Our focus is on developing employees so that they reach their full potential.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;FanDuel is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities. If you have a disability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please email&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The requirements listed in our job descriptions are guidelines, not hard and fast rules. You don’t have to satisfy every requirement or meet every qualification listed. If your skills are transferable and you are in the ballpark experience-wise, we&#39;d love to speak to you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is the leading SaaS platform for public relations and communications professionals. Our mission is to enable organizations to build trust, tell their stories, and demonstrate the unique value of earned media. Muck Rack’s AI-powered, comprehensive, and integrated platform streamlines the PR workflow to help businesses generate positive media coverage, monitor mentions to manage brand reputation, and analyze PR’s impact on business outcomes. By combining media database, monitoring, and reporting into one dynamic platform, we empower teams to collaborate seamlessly, pitch effectively, and analyze results faster and more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled, fully distributed, and growing sustainably, Muck Rack has received several awards for its unparalleled culture and product from organizations like Inc., Quartz, G2, and BuiltIn. We value resilience, transparency, ownership, and customer devotion, and infuse these values into everything we do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a collaborative, self-motivated &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Fullstack&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing Search team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, Fullstack, you’ll help build and evolve the customer-facing search experiences that help users discover relevant, high-quality content, along with the backend systems that power them. You’ll work across the stack, with a slight emphasis on frontend development, and collaborate closely with engineers, Product, and Design to deliver intuitive search experiences backed by reliable, scalable search and data systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver customer-facing search features and workflows across frontend and backend systems, from technical planning through production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered product experiences end to end, from the services behind them to the interfaces that make their output useful and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build intuitive, responsive user experiences using Vue while contributing to the Python and Django services that power them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve search, indexing, and retrieval systems that support high-quality content discovery across large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain features and data workflows that leverage technologies such as Elasticsearch, Kafka, Celery, and MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful technical decisions and trade-offs that balance customer experience, delivery speed, performance, reliability, and long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, and engineering teammates to shape solutions, clarify requirements, and deliver high-quality customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex production issues and drive improvements to the performance, reliability, observability, and maintainability of the systems you work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call and incident response rotation, helping diagnose and resolve production issues and improve system reliability over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You&#39;ll Need to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience building and maintaining production software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working across frontend and backend systems and independently delivering features throughout the application stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Python or a similar programming language and experience with Django or a comparable web framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building polished, maintainable user-facing applications with Vue.js or another modern JavaScript framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Elasticsearch or a comparable search technology, or significant experience working with data-intensive systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience making technical trade-offs within complex production systems while balancing immediate delivery needs with long-term quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience diagnosing production issues and contributing to the reliability and operational health of the systems you build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TypeScript in a large codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design systems or shared component libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to adjust working hours for overlap with teammates in US time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If Any of the Below Also Describe You, This Could Be an Exciting Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or other streaming or event-driven technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MySQL, Postgres, or other relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Celery or other asynchronous task-processing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building search, discovery, indexing, or information-retrieval features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving frontend architecture, performance, or complex customer-facing workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-traffic SaaS applications or systems that process large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building customer-facing features backed by LLMs or other AI models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience judging whether an AI-backed feature is actually working, through evaluation, testing, or user feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in journalism, news, media, or social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Addition, We&#39;re Always Looking for Candidates Who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex technical ideas clearly and collaborate effectively with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of problems and drive work forward independently while knowing when to involve others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in building readable, testable, maintainable software while making pragmatic technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach ambiguous or complex problems thoughtfully and use sound judgment to identify effective solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a strong engineering culture through thoughtful code reviews, knowledge sharing, feedback, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively incorporates AI tools into day-to-day work to improve productivity and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Interview Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below you&#39;ll find an outline of the interview plan for this role. Please note that this is what we expect the process to look like; we may ask you for supplemental information or require an additional step before making a final decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min interview with a member of our Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1 hour zoom interview with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €95,000–€110,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in Bulgaria is €6,000+ gross per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual compensation decisions are based on a number of factors, including experience level, skillset, and balancing internal equity relative to peers at the company. We expect the majority of the candidates who are offered roles at our company to fall healthily throughout the range based on these factors. We recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted. If that ends up being the case, the updated salary range will be communicated with you as a candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Muck Rack?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Work, Forever&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully distributed team with a permanent remote setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend, phone and internet reimbursement, coworking membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-person team bonding (lunches, events, competitions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent &amp;amp; Fair Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive geo-neutral pay in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual reviews to ensure equity and market alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardized bonus or commission structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, vision, disability, and life insurance for employees and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% premium coverage for individuals on high-deductible plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Virtual Care and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-funded HSA contributions and other pre-tax benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly wellness stipend and free Headspace subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Family Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;4+ weeks of PTO, plus paid sick and mental health days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13 paid holidays with the option to swap for personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent pathways for internal mobility and promotion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-annual performance reviews, team workshops, and leadership training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited access to Coursera and O’Reilly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 additional PTO days annually for learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive, Customer-First Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to equity and valuing diverse perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile, founder-led company focused on collaboration and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by 3,000+ companies worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Benefits and compensation reflect offerings for U.S.-based employees. Support is provided for employees in other locations, in compliance with local laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we are a fully distributed team, we do have limitations on where we can hire and maintain a list of acceptable working locations based on job function. If we are unable to hire in your current location for the role for which you applied, you will be notified via email. While we enjoy many benefits as a permanently distributed and remote company, we cannot always support relocation or extended travel and have guidelines in place to ensure compliant work away from your designated permanent residence.&lt;/p&gt;
