&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Project Manager experienced managing technical teams and releases across complex client environments required to join our Team!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll encourage strong relationships with your team and have the ability to talk, at a technical level, with developers and senior technical team members (e.g., technical architects, solution architects etc). You will follow best practices in development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development principals and CI/CD.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release and technical reporting regarding project/account technical deliverables, architecture and release pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of project plans and detailed reporting to ensure efficient tracking of the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RAID log management and escalation for the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical risks and issues &amp;amp; provide mitigation options to achieve resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeably communicate with stakeholders (internal/external) including chairing technical meetings as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and co-ordinate Internal technical specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire the team to achieve individual and team objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the technical team(s) complete what is expected of them successfully and suggest improvements to processes as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, plan, organise and manage the build of new infrastructure environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-ordinate high quality technical solutions, on time, via effective time management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help implement and benchmark the introduction of AI into SDLC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively run complex projects using Agile or Waterfall methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee releases across pre-production and production environments, demonstrating an understanding of dependencies between client systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement technical governance according to the client’s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer confidence by understanding their needs &amp;amp; delivering first class solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and manage client expectations, addressing issues in a respectful and timely manner and ensuring the organisation maintains a positive image and provides a high-quality service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage 3rd party product vendors, environments, and client technical resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in software development Project Management, supply chain and logistics experience ideally within a retail environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Ecommerce experience is nice to have but this role mainly works on the logistics and supply chain system delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read log files, draw conclusions and direct further technical investigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Cloud Technology for Back End and React/Node for Front End&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud/on premise infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A basic understanding of Terraform - at a level you can engage with technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Google Cloud Platform and Legacy AWS applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining, managing and delivering to customer expectations within strict deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full knowledge of the project lifecycle and experience of various project development methodologies (including Agile, Incremental and Waterfall)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with complex technical environments and legacy systems integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of code management tools such as git, bit bucket, svn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of GitHub or other release pipeline tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing 3rd parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong time management &amp;amp; organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation skills and an ability to handle sensitive issues with tact and diplomacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Project Management qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A developer background or programming qualification is advantageous but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Microsoft Office Packages, especially MS Excel and MS PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum BA/BS degree with a major in information management, marketing, communications, business or other closely-related areas is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;How we use AI in the recruitment process:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;To ensure more focused and engaging conversations, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI in our recruitment process exclusively for secure, objective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;note-taking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;, never for evaluative judgments. This allows our team to be fully present with you. You are always welcome to request a transcript of these notes or opt out of this feature at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opting out will not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;impact&amp;nbsp; the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;outcome of the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp; WPP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; Enterprise Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernisation, connecting strategy directly to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX, work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have received distinction as a leader in Commerce Services and CX Strategy Consulting by the Forrester Wave™&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;To find out more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://enterprisesolutions.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;enterprisesolutions.wpp.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and follow us on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpp-enterprise-solutions&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA #LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At VML Live, we inspire growth for ambitious brands through sport and entertainment. For more than 25 years, we’ve made it our mission to engage audiences across the world’s biggest sports, major competitions, and bespoke experiences. We work solely for brands, and we are rights-holder agnostic, meaning that we won’t compromise on driving the best results and ROI for our clients through their sport and entertainment partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a close-knit, collaborative team with a unique and vibrant culture. Clients value our creativity, our innovative thinking and our strategic, insight-based approach to every challenge. With our HQ in London with offices in other key worldwide locations, we are proud to be part of the Wunderman Thompson global network, and a WPP Group agency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role provides an exciting opportunity to join a large WPP agency team managing global activation and content for a major F1 team partner brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a driven Senior Partnership Manager to play a lead role in liaising with the F1 team, other WPP agencies, our client’s global brand team and our client’s central partnership team, as we work to support them in delivering their partnership activation plans with best-in-class project management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based at our office, Sea Containers in Blackfriars, the Senior Partnership Manager will work within a five person immediate Brand team which sits within a wider client team of 14. This is a client facing role, with line management responsibilities, which provides extensive autonomy and significant opportunity for growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key senior member of the account management team with the confidence, knowledge and experience to guide the client with a solutions-driven focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day to day responsibility for development and delivery of complex creative content projects, all with the aim of bringing to life our client’s F1 partnership for their key target audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the lead in working closely with the brand team, regional/end market clients and relevant internal teams to ensure all activation plans are proactively delivered to a high standard with full approval of the F1 team and internal client stakeholders as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, influence, and maintain a productive partnership with the core client, their regions and end markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across multiple projects with seamless efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a strong working relationship with the F1 team to foster a collective culture of creativity, problem solving and positivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess outstanding project management skills and a high level of organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating and collaborating with cross-discipline team members to make sure that all parties are on track with project requirements, deadlines, and schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Account Director with regular client and F1 team reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand our current business relationships by identifying and securing growth opportunities as part of the dedicated projects and across the wider business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an awareness of best practice in sponsorship activation to fully maximise the potential of market activation plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience of managing complex and creative content projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appropriate years of account management experience, preferably working within F1 or with another major sports sponsor and their markets on a global basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in working to tight deadlines as well as successfully managing complex client finance, briefs and proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to juggle multiple work streams, stakeholders and projects with a flexible attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset with the ability to operate in global regions seamlessly when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator with experience of successfully managing client expectation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm, energy and an innovative approach to the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile mindset and ability to pivot as project requirements change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient and forward thinking in nature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills with impeccable attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player with a positive attitude and desire to grow both personally and professionally as the role requires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the ability to generate creative ideas that make our current and prospective clients sit up and notice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to travel both inside and outside of the UK as may be required from time to time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write and speak a leading foreign language, whilst not essential, would be beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for entertainment, culture, and sport is highly sought after&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior UX Design Developer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote (UK-based)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; UX Design&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid role blending user experience design and frontend prototyping&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe the best user experiences are designed through exploration, iteration, and hands-on prototyping. We’re looking for a Senior UX Design Developer who thrives at the intersection of design and code—someone equally comfortable designing experiences and bringing them to life in code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll use code as a design tool—not simply as an implementation medium—to explore ideas, validate interactions, and shape product direction. As design and implementation continue to converge through modern frontend tooling and AI-native workflows, we’re looking for someone excited to help define what that future looks like at Ping Identity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our UX team, you’ll help shape the experiences customers use to discover, configure, manage, and get the most out of Ping Identity’s products. Working closely with designers, product managers, researchers, and engineers, you’ll transform ideas into interactive prototypes that validate concepts, influence product direction, and help ensure exceptional implementation quality across our products and supporting experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype interactive user experiences in code to explore, communicate, and validate ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype workflows, interactions, and usability concepts before implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design user experiences for complex enterprise SaaS applications and supporting customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, UX researchers, designers, and engineers to define requirements and shape product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering throughout development to ensure designs are implemented with exceptional quality and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for design quality by reviewing implementations and helping ensure the final product reflects the original design intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance user needs, accessibility requirements, technical constraints, and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use modern design tools to explore concepts, communicate visual design, and contribute to our design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build prototypes using modern frontend technologies including React, Vue, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of our design system, reusable UI patterns, and coded component libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-native design and development tools to accelerate ideation, generate realistic prototype data, build interactive experiences, and explore multiple design directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and prototype AI-assisted experiences such as conversational interfaces, guided configuration, and intelligent recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion thoughtful UX practices and contribute to Ping’s growing design culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide constructive design feedback and mentor other designers through critique and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in UX Design, Human-Computer Interaction, Computer Science, or a related field—or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in UX design, frontend development, or a hybrid design/development role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating both thoughtful UX design and interactive coded prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency with modern UX design tools and component-based design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building interactive applications using React, Vue, or similar modern frontend frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of JavaScript, HTML, CSS, responsive design, and frontend best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using code as a prototyping medium—not just for production implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with component-based design systems and frontend component libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of accessibility standards and WCAG guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interaction design skills and attention to visual detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate design decisions and technical tradeoffs effectively with designers, engineers, and product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-native tools and workflows to accelerate design, prototyping, or frontend development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about emerging interaction patterns for AI-powered products and experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing enterprise SaaS products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in identity, authentication, or cybersecurity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in both UX design and frontend engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-native design and development tools such as Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, v0, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Ping Identity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identity is foundational to digital security and trust. At Ping Identity, you’ll help create products that enable organizations around the world to securely connect people, applications, and devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a collaborative UX team that partners closely with Product and Engineering to solve challenging enterprise problems through design, research, rapid prototyping, and modern development practices. If you’re passionate about crafting exceptional user experiences by combining thoughtful design with code—and excited by the possibilities of AI-native workflows—we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role sits in our Platform Engineering team, which delivers features and design work that spans the Ping platform. The team is focused on building Ping&#39;s identity for AI offerings to secure and govern AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer who can turn ideas into production capabilities and work well in a fast-paced, collaborative, cross-functional, and global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal applicant will bring strong software development experience, sound technical judgment, creative problem-solving skills, and a passion for research, innovation, and experimentation. They will be excited by work that spans products, services, APIs, models, and user experiences, and by using AI tooling as a practical part of the engineering workflow to accelerate discovery and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to contribute to features that help customers identify, secure, and govern AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Will&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver IAM (Identity &amp;amp; Access Management) capabilities across the Ping platform encompassing the whole stack from infrastructure and databases through to UI experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and implementation of APIs, models, workflows, orchestration surfaces, and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and prototype solutions in emerging areas, working with senior technical leaders and product teams to turn validated ideas into product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product management, UX, and engineering teams across Ping to refine features and designs to deliver elegant, usable, and scalable outcomes for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in development life cycle activities such as design, coding, testing, rollout, and production support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use modern AI tooling such as Claude Code as part of day-to-day engineering work to accelerate research, code understanding, prototyping, implementation, and documentation while maintaining strong engineering judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly, share knowledge, and support other engineers through design discussions, code reviews, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a rapidly changing environment, continuously adapting to evolving customer needs, technology trends, and new ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design, build, test, and operate production services using technologies such as Java, JavaScript, Google Cloud, Docker, and Kubernetes, together with the desire to broaden your expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use AI engineering tools to accelerate research, code understanding, prototyping, implementation, and documentation while applying sound engineering judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production services, distributed systems, or shared platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing APIs, RESTful services, integration contracts, and data or domain models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning requirements and ambiguous problems into designs, prototypes, and production-ready solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with authentication, authorisation, and identity management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate technical decisions clearly, collaborate across teams and time zones, and support other engineers through feedback and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus Points If You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, token exchange, policy systems, delegated administration, or identity data modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI agent identity and non-human identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MCP, agent skills, and other agent integration concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple codebases, teams, or product areas to ship cohesive outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as part of an international team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to technical designs and proof of concept work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
