&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on role that combines software testing, system integration, and on-site support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;You will&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hands-on with real systems, travel to interesting locations, and develop both technical and communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
