&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW255359969 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW255359969 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Travel is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW255359969 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW255359969 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; in this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Firmware&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Metrea, our single core value is Rooted in Humility, and our four cornerstone attributes are Entrepreneurial, Systematic, Discerning, and Over-Deliver. These form what we call our Teammate Firmware. Just like technical firmware connects software and hardware, our Firmware is the constant interface between our mission and our people. It defines how we show up, how we work together, and how we solve complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team Firmware creates a web-like, hyper-collaborative, dynamically hierarchical way of working that helps us adapt quickly, communicate openly, and distribute decision-making to where expertise actually lives. It enables groups to self-organize around hard problems, shift fluidly as priorities evolve, and operate with the trust, curiosity, and discipline required in a complex mission space. This foundation allows us to deliver elegant, effective solutions and uphold our purpose: protecting our precious inheritance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Our office is located in Oxford, England (UK), with hybrid working&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1820&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Electronics Engineer to join our Reliability Engineering team at IonQ. In this role, you will be responsible for finding, root-causing, and permanently resolving electronics &amp;nbsp;and control hardware issues on our operational trapped-ion quantum computers, contributing to the team&#39;s mission of improving fleet uptime and driving down the operational cost of our commercial and development systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play an important part in owning the full lifecycle of electrical reliability fixes — from identifying a real-world bottleneck through to standardizing the resulting fix into every future build — working closely with Operations, Science, Manufacturing, and Engineering to keep our quantum systems running reliably and effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position, you will work on &lt;strong&gt;root-causing, designing, and deploying electronics system design fixes &lt;/strong&gt;across our fleet of quantum systems, supporting the effective delivery of &lt;strong&gt;reliable, development and production hardware&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to &lt;strong&gt;drive system upgrades, standardize control and drive electronics across systems, and build the observability that catches problems before they cause downtime&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing directly to the success of &lt;strong&gt;the Reliability Engineering team&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triage &amp;amp; root cause:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively monitor, root-cause, and prioritize electrical, control-system, and drive-electronics issues on live systems based on severity and impact to uptime and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution development: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, prototype, build, and test electrical fixes — spanning schematic capture, PCB layout, and board- and system-level test — taking solutions from concept through to permanent integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability upgrade leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive electrical workstreams for major fleet-wide upgrades (e.g. control-hardware consolidation, drive-electronics standardization, remote telemetry/monitoring for laser and system health) to reduce variance and downtime across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retrofitting &amp;amp; deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate directly with Operations and Science teams to schedule, deploy, and retrofit upgrades onto live systems while managing operational constraints, and verify fixes improve system performance, reliability or operability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; standardization&lt;/strong&gt;: Feed validated fixes back into engineering documentation, build manifests, and the Engineering Change Request (ECR) process so every improvement is baked into the baseline for all future builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful, you will need strong foundations in analogue, RF, and mixed-signal electronics design,&amp;nbsp;experience with the Altium PCB toolset, familiarity with RF concepts and confidence working directly on&amp;nbsp;operational hardware under time pressure. We&#39;re looking for someone who can translate a system-level&amp;nbsp;reliability problem into a concrete engineering solution, work across Operations, Science, and Engineering&amp;nbsp;to get it deployed safely, and document it so it sticks. You&#39;d be a great fit with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analogue and mixed-signal electronics: &lt;/strong&gt;strong practical experience designing and debugging op-amp circuits, low-noise amplifiers, filters, ADC/DAC modules, grounding, shielding and common digital interfaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Altium design control and documentation: &lt;/strong&gt;strong experience managing evolving schematics and PCB designs in Altium, producing clear technical documentation, and establishing effective review, ERC/DRC, release and change-control processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fault-finding and electrical integration: &lt;/strong&gt;able to diagnose power supplies, analogue circuits and control electronics, and develop reliable PCBs, adapters, connectors, breakout cables and harnesses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder engagement and delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;able to gather requirements, explain technical issues and trade-offs across different disciplines, and take solutions through testing, deployment and documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus: &lt;/strong&gt;familiarity with LVDS and FPGA-based control electronics, cryogenic or RF/microwave systems, and Python-based test automation or telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Oxford, England, United Kingdom&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; As Needed&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1805&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an enthusiastic and highly technical Director, Systems Software who will thrive in our dynamic cross-disciplinary environment. You’d be working closely with our skilled software engineers and our world-leading quantum scientists to plan and manage the development of software that powers our quantum computers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will initially be leading a software team of around twenty software engineers with future growth of the team expected. We develop a full stack solution ranging from the real-time control &amp;amp; monitoring of our systems through an IR and quantum compiler layer to application demonstration. Your role will be critical in both specifying the stack as components that can be individually developed and released, and growing the team into a world-class organisation capable of developing and supporting the stack for internal and external customers.&amp;nbsp; A critical part of this will be to establish and drive suitable development, devops, release, and 3rd line support processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The quantum core of our hardware is built from trapped-ion qubits, controlled by devices designed and made by a partner tier 1 fab.&amp;nbsp; We control the ions using electrical signals and laser light, driven by real-time FPGA systems and networked equipment.&amp;nbsp; The required sequences and operations are derived both by low-level experiments that our science teams produce, and by a compilation flow from quantum algorithms.&amp;nbsp; Our software stack is a combination of Python and Rust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced full-stack software manager, previous exposure to quantum systems is not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position, you’ll have the opportunity to accelerate the delivery of our software projects, contributing directly to the success of our research and development roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A focus in this role will be leading the definition and evolution of any internal team processes and the devops processes as our stack matures. You will work collaboratively with other teams to develop stronger cross-team interfaces and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your key responsibilities can be split into two categories:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the software team and work with other technical teams to build and maintain long-term roadmaps for our various software projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture feature requests from internal conversations and external requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand conflicting priorities and manage the team to deliver according to company needs and timescales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive detailed software solutions, working with the software team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear updates on issues and progress to all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the software team’s backlog, working with the team members and project management group to keep it up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the first point of call for others in the company to understand how the software fits together at a high level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the effectiveness and efficiency of the software team and ensuring the team maintains the right balance of delivery speed and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support members of the software team, including looking out for their wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting the performance reviews for the team and supporting their career development at IonQ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the VP of Engineering to plan future growth of the software team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful, you will need proven experience managing a software organisation containing tens of engineers and subject matter experts in their respective fields.You will have a track record in setting priorities, giving clear expectations and ensuring results are suitable for the internal and external customers, with a clear understanding of critical versus urgent items.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to delegate at the appropriate level while maintaining good quality output at the pace needed in a high-tech startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed technical background in more than one of the following areas: real time embedded software, compiler development, assembler development, graph algorithmic representations, system monitoring, data centre deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of standard software development processes and a pragmatic approach to their use in a growing organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent technical and organisational communication skills, both across the organisation and to external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It would also be beneficial to have an understanding of branching and release practices and when to use them and/or how to organise internal triage and support as our external customer base grows. Additional desirable experience would be experience in tracking team delivery of new features, including scoping, estimation, release planning and tracking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is a place where you can bring your purpose to life through the work that you do, creating a safer world through our cybersecurity SaaS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture of flexibility, trust, and continual learning means you will be recognized for your growth and for the impact you make on our success. You will be surrounded by people who challenge, support, and inspire you to be the best version of yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Migrations Account Executive works collaboratively to grow and expand BeyondTrust’s customer base, primarily by working with perpetual customers to drive renewal retention, expansion, and deployment migration. The Migrations Account Executive communicates directly with external contacts including but not limited to customers, partners, and distributors as well as with internal departments across the Go to Market team and other cross-functional groups to effectively maintain and improve upon the processes and procedures in place to maximize customer revenue retention through renewal bookings and improve customer satisfaction and experience, with a specialized focus on SaaS upgrades.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Migrations Account Executive has an exemplary track record in successfully managing customer relationships as well as tracking towards set renewal and expansion KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributes to the attainment of the annual renewal bookings quota and company migration target quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as the point of contact on all items relating to perpetual customer accounts in a given customer segment in either renewal or migration motion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participates with add-on and upsell opportunities related to renewals/migrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibits competencies in reporting, including building and interpreting data related to TAR, ACV attained, Point of Renewal Add-ons, and Closed/Lost opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in customer negotiation and problem-solving, proposing effective and creative resolutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands and communicates product use-cases, especially relating to SaaS upgrade motions and value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skillfully handles escalations and understands how to defuse situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently displays a proactive approach to work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishes and maintains professional and mutually beneficial alignments with associated internal teams (Sales, Order Management, Renewal Operations, Billing, Fulfillment, Support, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands the Bookings Policy and consistently adheres to policy &amp;amp; team expectations for resolving orders on hold&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business, or comparable industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with an ability to communicate cross-functionally across the organization, as well as externally with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization skills and ability to multitask, self-start, and self-direct work in an independent and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with teams in diverse functional areas, with effective interpersonal skills necessary to build positive, productive, and effective professional working relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of automation, analytics, and general office technology, including operations, development, and general office administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven analytical and problem resolution skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ability to prioritize in meeting multiple goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to internal controls, best practices, and efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Microsoft Office and Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work outside of normal office hours during peak times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5 years+ of related experience in a software or technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the sales industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;com and/or large CRM/ERP experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Fortune 100 clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Better Together&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity. Inclusion. They’re more than just words for us. They are the guiding values of how we build our teams, cultivate leaders, and create a culture where people feel connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take care of our employees so they can take care of our customers. Customers who come from all walks of life are just like us. We hire incredible people from diverse backgrounds because when we are different together, we are stronger together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Us&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is the global identity security leader protecting Paths to Privilege™. Our identity-centric approach goes beyond securing privileges and access, empowering organizations with the most effective solution to manage the entire identity attack surface and neutralize threats, whether from external attacks or insiders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is leading the charge in transforming identity security to prevent breaches and limit the blast radius of attacks, while creating a superior customer experience and operational efficiencies. We are trusted by 20,000 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 100, and our global ecosystem of partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.beyondtrust.com/&quot;&gt;www.beyondtrust.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MB1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Real Chemistry, making the world a healthier place isn’t just an aspiration—it’s our everyday reality. Our drive to transform healthcare is informed by our blend of deep scientific expertise, human-centred creativity, and AI-driven insights, fostering a unique environment where innovation thrives and our people are impact-obsessed. As a global agency, we provide a full suite of services across healthcare communications and marketing to our clients, including top players in the pharmaceutical and biotech industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our #LifeatRealChem culture is rooted in our people—we believe we are best together and are committed to excellence for both our clients and colleagues. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned professional or just starting your career, if you share our passion for healthcare and connection, we invite you to explore our opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover your purpose. Embrace innovation. Experience #LifeatRealChem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Medical Writer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Senior Medical Writers&lt;/strong&gt; are responsible for driving day-to-day project delivery (with support from others) within an account in order to create outstanding medical content across a variety of therapy areas. This position is ideal for an experienced writer who has a passion for scientific and medical developments, a keen interest in AI, and who enjoys tackling new problems, interacting with clients, and mentoring internal team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scientific knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently steps into new therapeutic areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starting to lead discussions with clients and external experts on therapy area, drivers which influence treatment decision-making and patient pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Helps to lead meetings and strategic discussions with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively utilizes a broad range of AI solutions to streamline complex projects, with support from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluates and implements AI-driven solutions to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of projects, identifying opportunities for improvement and collaborating with team members to optimize project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides guidance and training to team members on best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads content delivery for complex projects with supervision from senior team, delegating to AMW/MWs as needed and where appropriate to ensure timely execution to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in achieving communications objectives by employing a broad range of channels and formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project development: &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interrogates briefs from clients/internal teams and proactively flags any queries or potential issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applies critical thinking skills towards a project brief to achieve deliverables in a timely and efficient manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides a proactive, solution-focused approach towards resolving queries, and addressing feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiates discussions with Account Teams regarding potential barriers to successful project completion that may arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editorial:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops compelling narratives from complex information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structures and writes novel projects that may not have been executed previously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality control:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes responsibility for overall quality of deliverables with supervision from senior team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviews JMWs’ work for adherence to brief, client objectives and quality of writing, providing constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On site: &lt;/strong&gt;Leads elements of the on-site programme across a variety of events with support from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client liaison: &lt;/strong&gt;Leads scientific discussion with clients and external experts as appropriate to capture briefs, resolve queries, and progress scientific content development in timely and efficient manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and new business&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports development of scientific content for new therapeutic areas for new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identifies new business opportunities with new and existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management: &lt;/strong&gt;Provides timely and accurate communication to accounts team on writer hours, and project progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;: Trains/mentors junior writers on account-specific therapy area knowledge and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications and skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should bring a strong scientific background with a degree in a scientific or medical discipline (post-graduate degree preferred). A high level of academic achievement is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should bring previous experience of medical writing at an MW level or above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for, and profound understanding of, healthcare, science, medicine, and the pharmaceutical industry is essential, as well as a keen interest in AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll need to be personable, articulate, and capable of nurturing relationships. Previous experience mentoring MWs and interacting regularly with clients is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Real Chemistry offers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks. Learn more about our great benefits and perks at: http://www.realchemistry.com/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe we can do our best when feeling our best, which is why we’ve put together a benefits program designed to give you the support you and your family need at every stage of life. Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks, tailored to your region. Globally, this includes offices in our key markets with free snacks to keep you running all day long, generous holiday and paid time off, options for private medical, dental, and vison plans, and support in saving for the future. Other perks include mental wellness coaching and support&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;access to more than 13,000 online classes with LinkedIn Learning.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Learn more about our great benefits and perks and search specific offerings in your region at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.realchemistrybenefits.com&quot;&gt;www.realchemistrybenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;At Real Chemistry, we believe we&#39;re at our best when we&#39;re connected. Our Real Hybrid and Regional Teams (Real HART) approach is designed to foster collaboration, learning, innovation, and meaningful relationships while providing flexibility where appropriate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Because our workforce spans multiple countries, regions, and client needs, work arrangements may vary by role and location. Some positions offer hybrid or remote flexibility, while others require regular in-office presence. For example, certain teams and regions, including some of our UK operations, have office-based requirements. Your recruiter will discuss the specific expectations for the role you&#39;re pursuing during the interview process and keep you informed throughout the hiring journey.&amp;nbsp;For employees located within a one-hour commute of a Real Chemistry office, we require in-person attendance two days per week, either from a Real Chemistry office or when working onsite with clients. Employees in regions without a nearby office may work remotely and come together throughout the year for collaboration, culture-building, learning, and team connection opportunities.&amp;nbsp;While these guidelines reflect our current workplace model, we understand that everyone’s circumstances are unique. If you require additional flexibility, we welcome an open conversation with your recruiter and our HR team to discuss your needs and determine what may be possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is an Equal Opportunity employer. We continually strive to build and sustain an inclusive and equitable work environment where our employees feel empowered to leverage all they bring from their personal lived experience and professional expertise, to make our team the best in the industry. We encourage motivated and qualified applicants to apply without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, ethnic or national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, marital information, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Real Chemistry operates. Should you require accommodations throughout the interview process please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Notice: Real Chemistry and its affiliates&#39; names are being misused by scammers through messaging services, fake websites, and apps. Do not share personal or financial information or make payments to any unverified sources claiming to be connected to Real Chemistry. We are working to stop these unauthorized activities and protect our community. Read more&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.realchemistry.com%2Fscam-alert&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185967986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=vBa1KYjD6TUHgTF3FdPRQZvM8E8WUgHZqu9yHevh1%2BI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With 30 offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Der fehlende Wirkungsnachweis ist das größte Problem im stationären Handel für Werbungtreibende. Obwohl Marken Millionen in Werbung am Point of Sale investieren, können sie nicht belegen, ob daraus Käufe wurden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Verve Retail Media (VRM) löst dieses Problem. Wir vermarkten und betreiben digitale Werbe-Screens in mehreren tausend LEH-, Drogerie- und Convenience-Standorten und verbinden sie mit digitalen Coupons, Retargeting im CTV und anderen Offsite-Kanälen. Marken buchen bei uns keine isolierten Werbeformate, sondern 360-Grad-Kampagnen, die zu Hause starten und bis zum Einkaufsregal reichen - eine Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;VRM ist die eigenständige Retail Media Unit der börsennotierten Verve Group SE. Wir arbeiten wie ein schnell skalierendes Startup mit AI-First-Strategie über alle Funktionen und mit Zugriff auf die Infrastruktur eines internationalen AdTech-Unternehmens mit über einer Billionen ausgelieferter Werbeimpressionen pro Jahr. Zur Verve Retail Media gehört seit kurzem der Couponing- und Cashback-Spezialist acardo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle in einem &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Satz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Du trägst eine Hunter-Mentalität in dir und gewinnst neue Umsätze bei FMCG-Marken, indem du integrierte Shopper Activation Kampagnen verkaufst: d.h. coupon-getriebene Conversion und messbarer Sales Lift, idealerweise erweitert um Screen-Präsenz im Markt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;du&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Die Aktivierung von Shoppern am Point of Sale (über Coupons, Cashback und andere Aktivierungsmethoden), erweitert um digitale Sichtbarkeit im Markt (Screens an Eingang, Fläche, Kasse) und Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten, teils auch losgelöste Coupon oder Cashback Maßnahmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Kampagnen, die zu mehr Abverkauf und Kategorie-Relevanz &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;führen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Konkrete Beweispunkte aus vielen tausenden acardo &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Kampagnen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An wen du &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Direkt an FMCG-&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Marken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Die Ansprechpartner kommen meist aus dem Trade Marketing oder Category &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Eigene Pipeline aufbauen, entwickeln, priorisieren und mit belastbarem Forecast &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;führen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Neukunden und Stakeholder (horizontal und vertikal) gewinnen und Kunden zu wiederkehrenden Partnern entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Bestehende Kunden ausbauen zu hohen, wiederkehrenden &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Volumina&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p11&quot;&gt;Den kompletten Sales-Zyklus verantworten: Erstansprache, Qualifizierung, Bedarfsanalyse, Angebot, Verhandlung und Abschluss. Mit Abschluss erfolgt die Übergabe ans AdOps Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Kundenziele in Aktivierungskonzepte übersetzen: Touchpoints, Reichweiten, Zielgruppen, Mechaniken (Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), Messansatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Feedback aus dem Markt in Produkt, Pitchmaterial und Go-to-Market &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;zurückspielen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So ist die Rolle &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;aufgesetzt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Du bist ein Individual Contributor ohne &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Personalverantwortung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Du berichtest direkt an den Head of Key Account &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Du verkaufst eigenständig, aber nicht allein: Inside Sales unterstützt bei der Abwicklung, Ad Operations steuert die Auslieferung, Data Science liefert den Wirkungsnachweis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Dein Fokus ist kommerziell: Pipeline, Abschluss, Kundentiefe, &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Wiederbuchung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p12&quot;&gt;Du passt zu uns, wenn du aus einer der folgenden Richtungen kommst und mindestens 3 Jahre Erfahrung mitbringst:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 1: FMCG Trade Marketing / CM-Side. &lt;/strong&gt;Du hast Erfahrung im Trade Marketing, Category Management, Shopper Marketing, oder Brand Marketing auf Herstellerseite. Du kennst Freigabelogiken, Jahresgespräche, Aktivierungsmechaniken und die Realität am Point of Sale. Du willst auf die Sell-Side wechseln und traust dir zu, eigenständig Deals abzuschließen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 2: Promotion-, Couponing-, Cashback- und Sampling-Vermarkter (acardo-Mitbewerber). &lt;/strong&gt;Marktguru, reebate, Sampling-/Produkttest-Anbieter, klassische Sales-Promotion-Dienstleister. Du sprichst bisher mit den gleichen Einkäufern, über das gleiche Budget, und gleiche Mechaniken (Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), und bringst bestehende Kontakte direkt im richtigen Buying Center mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 3: Sales-Data- / Markt-Measurement-Vertrieb. &lt;/strong&gt;Du kommst aus dem Vertrieb bei NielsenIQ, Circana, IRI, GfK oder ähnlichen Data oder Insights Anbietern, und hast dort den Closed-Loop- und Sales-Lift-Pitch an das Category Management verkauft. Deshalb beherrschst du die Sprache „Abverkauf / Wirkungsnachweis / Kategorie-Relevanz&quot; – also genau das Herzstück unseres Versprechens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 4: Loyalty-/CRM-/Couponing-Plattformen, die in FMCG-Trade-Budgets verkaufen. &lt;/strong&gt;Dein zuhause war bisher bei Payback, DeutschlandCard und ähnlichen CRM Anbietern. Dein Wirkungskreis waren Coupon-Mechanik plus Daten, verkauft an Trade Marketing. Dadurch bringst du entsprechende Kundenkontakte mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Für&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;alle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;gilt:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Du bist kommerziell getrieben, mit klarem Gespür für Dealstruktur, Pricing und &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Kundennutzen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Souverän auf Senior-Level: z.B. Trade-Marketing-Entscheider, Marken &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Direktoren&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Strukturiert in Pipeline-Pflege und &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Forecasting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Kannst mit Daten argumentieren, hast keine Scheu vor AI-Tools und neuen &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Sprichst Deutsch und Englisch &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;fließend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;diese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Du liebst es, Dinge erfolgreich zu machen. Du nutzt unsere erprobte Vermarktungsmaschine und im Markt bekannte Produkte, mit denen du Deals gewinnst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Echte Ownership: deine Pipeline, deine Kunden, dein &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Umsatz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Direkter Zugang zu CSO und CEO bei strategischen &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Kunden&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Ein Produkt, das mehr kann als Aktivierung verkaufen: Sichtbarkeit, Reichweite und messbare Wirkung bis zum Kauf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li16&quot;&gt;AI-gestützte Tools und Workflows, die deine Produktivität &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;vervielfachen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;Wenn du bestehende Playbooks magst, die du immer weiter optimierst, ist das die richtige &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Rolle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bewerbungsprozess&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p19&quot;&gt;Schick deinen Lebenslauf zusammen mit einer kurzen Arbeitsprobe (max. 1 Seite). Wähle eine reale Situation: einen Deal gegen Widerstände gewonnen, eine Kundenbeziehung von Null aufgebaut, ein neues Konzept mit messbarem Ergebnis oder ein kommerzielles Problem, das du gelöst hast. Was wir verstehen wollen:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Was war das Problem? Nicht der Kontext. Das tatsächliche &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Was hast du getan? Nicht das Team. Was hast du entschieden, gebaut oder &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;verändert?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Was war das messbare Ergebnis? Umsatz, Conversion, Kundenbindung. Sei &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;konkret.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li20&quot;&gt;Was würdest du heute anders &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;machen?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;Schreib es wie ein Memo, das dein CEO in 3 Minuten lesen kann. Ohne Füllmaterial. Die Arbeitsprobe ersetzt das Anschreiben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p22&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Verve bietet allen Mitarbeitenden und Bewerber:innen gleiche Beschäftigungschancen und verbietet Diskriminierung und Belästigung&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;jeglicher&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Art,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;unabhängig&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;von&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Herkunft,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Geschlecht,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Religion,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alter,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;sexueller&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Orientierung,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Geschlechtsidentität, Behinderung oder anderen gesetzlich geschützten Merkmalen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With 30 offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Der fehlende Wirkungsnachweis ist das größte Problem im stationären Handel für Werbungtreibende.&amp;nbsp;Obwohl Marken Millionen in Werbung am Point of Sale investieren, können sie nicht belegen, ob daraus&lt;br&gt;Käufe wurden.&amp;nbsp;Verve Retail Media (VRM) löst dieses Problem. Wir vermarkten und betreiben digitale Werbe-Screens in&amp;nbsp;mehreren tausend LEH-, Drogerie- und Convenience-Standorten und verbinden sie mit digitalen&lt;br&gt;Coupons, Retargeting im CTV und anderen Offsite-Kanälen. Marken buchen bei uns keine isolierten Werbeformate, sondern 360-Grad-Kampagnen, die zu Hause starten und bis zum Einkaufsregal reichen -eine Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VRM ist die eigenständige Retail Media Unit der börsennotierten Verve Group SE. Wir arbeiten wie ein&amp;nbsp;schnell skalierendes Startup mit AI-First-Strategie über alle Funktionen und mit Zugriff auf die&amp;nbsp;Infrastruktur eines internationalen AdTech-Unternehmens mit über einer Billionen ausgelieferter&amp;nbsp;Werbeimpressionen pro Jahr. Zur Verve Retail Media gehört seit kurzem der Couponing- und&amp;nbsp;Cashback-Spezialist acardo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle in einem Satz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du trägst eine Hunter-Mentalität in dir und gewinnst neue Umsätze bei FMCG-Marken, indem du&amp;nbsp;integrierte Shopper Activation Kampagnen verkaufst: d.h. coupon-getriebene Conversion und messbarer&amp;nbsp;Sales Lift, idealerweise erweitert um Screen-Präsenz im Markt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein kombiniertes Produkt aus digitaler Sichtbarkeit im Markt Screens an Eingang, Fläche, Kasse), Aktivierung am Point of Sale (über Coupons) und Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten (anstatt isolierter Werbeflächen oder losgelöster Coupons)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kampagnen, die drei Logiken beim Kunden verbinden: Markenreichweite, Abverkauf und Kategorie-Relevanz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;360Grad-Aktivierung, die über den Markt hinausgeht: (Re)Targeting im CTV und weiteren Offsite-Kanälen als Verlängerung der In-Store-Kampagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Konkrete Beweispunkte aus Pilotprojekten: z.B. 9% Uplift auf Store-Ebene, 20% in ausgewählten Kategorien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An wen du verkaufst&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkt an FMCG-Marken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Ansprechpartner kommen meist aus Brand und Media (-Planung und -Einkauf) und verwalten &lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;drei Budgettöpfe mit unterschiedlichen Zielen, Freigabelogiken und Erfolgsmetriken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigene Pipeline aufbauen, entwickeln, priorisieren und mit belastbarem Forecast führen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neukunden und Stakeholder (horizontal und vertikal) gewinnen und Kunden zu wiederkehrenden Partnern entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Den kompletten Sales-Zyklus verantworten: Erstansprache, Qualifizierung, Bedarfsanalyse, Angebot, Verhandlung und Abschluss. Mit Abschluss erfolgt die Übergabe ans AdOps Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kundenziele in Media- und Aktivierungskonzepte übersetzen: Touchpoints, Reichweiten, Zielgruppen, Mechaniken Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), Messansatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales-Lift-Daten und Pilotergebnisse als Beweispunkte im Pitch einsetzen, um aus ersten Testbudgets hohe wiederkehrende Volumina zu machen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VRM gegenüber konkurrierenden Retail-Media-Formaten klar differenzieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback aus dem Markt in Produkt, Pitchmaterial und Go-to-Market zurückspielen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So ist die Rolle aufgesetzt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist ein Individual Contributor ohne Personalverantwortung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du berichtest direkt an die CSO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verkaufst eigenständig, aber nicht allein: Media Planning entwickelt das Kampagnen-Setup, Ad Operations steuert die Auslieferung, Data Science liefert den Wirkungsnachweis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dein Fokus ist kommerziell: Pipeline, Abschluss, Kundentiefe, Wiederbuchung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum diese Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du liebst es, Dinge von Grund auf mit aufzubauen. Denn bei uns steigst du nicht in eine fertige Vermarktungsmaschine mit festem Produktkatalog ein, sondern du baust eine neue Mediagattung im deutschen Markt mit auf. Die Deals, die du jetzt gewinnst, werden intern und extern zu Referenzen. Sie prägen, wie Marken und Agenturen In-Store Retail Media künftig bewerten und einkaufen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Echte Ownership: deine Pipeline, deine Kunden, dein Umsatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkter Zugang zu CSO und CEO bei strategischen Kunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein Produkt, das mehr kann als Reichweite verkaufen: Sichtbarkeit, Aktivierung und messbare Wirkung bis zum Kauf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-gestützte Tools und Workflows, die deine Produktivität vervielfachen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du lieber Benchmarks setzt als bestehende Playbooks abarbeitest, ist das die richtige Rolle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Verve bietet allen Mitarbeitenden und Bewerber:innen gleiche Beschäftigungschancen und verbietet Diskriminierung und&amp;nbsp;Belästigung jeglicher Art, unabhängig von Herkunft, Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, Geschlechtsidentität,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Behinderung oder anderen gesetzlich geschützten Merkmalen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;As a Working Student in Integrated Planning, you will support our team in coordinating and continuously improving production planning processes. You will contribute to the digitalization of our rocket production, help create transparency across planning activities and support the successful execution of our production plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
