&lt;p&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in launch vehicle design, manufacturing, or assembly techniques for structure and fluid systems &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in aerospace hydraulic system&amp;nbsp;component&amp;nbsp;design &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General knowledge of aerospace/aviation hardware design&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of fabrication, integration processes, and quality control&amp;nbsp;relative&amp;nbsp;to tubes/piping and machined components &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on hardware production or assembly experience  &amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
