&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we’re on a mission to empower small businesses around the world with simple, affordable tools to help them start, run, and grow. More than 4 million merchants across 36 markets trust us as their financial partner — and we’re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a global team of 3,000+ people from over 90 nationalities, united by curiosity, collaboration, and care. Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/1axu-TmW088?si=5NjHKNq5n-1GbXc2&quot;&gt;core values&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/XEH_nmJ9KZ4?si=pr6TdFl98FhpD5KG&quot;&gt;culture&lt;/a&gt; shape everything we do, fostering inclusion, learning, and belonging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, committed to building a safe, respectful, and diverse workplace where everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Explore more about our culture on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers site&lt;/a&gt;, or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
